title: "tashkeel-nano: tiny Arabic diacritization models and the pipeline that trains them"
abstract: >-
  Character-level bidirectional Transformer encoders with a 15-class diacritic
  head, a 1.08M-parameter model at 11.51% DER and a 4.49M-parameter model, plus
  the full data, training, soup, and evaluation pipeline that produced them.
